  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose that the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lie on the line <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> If a line <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> passing through the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> equals:",
